title: "SkeleSketch: An Open-Source Tool for Quantifying Microglial Morphology in Fiji/ImageJ"
abstract: "An open-source Fiji/ImageJ plugin for semi-automated skeletonization, morphometric quantification, and data organization of microglia from standard epifluorescence images, with optional user-guided correction."
